<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" name="viewport"> <title>Style metadata snapshot case</title> </head> <body> <main> <header id="title-block-header"> <h1>Style metadata snapshot case</h1> </header> <h1 id="sec:styled-paragraph">1 Styled paragraph</h1> <p>This paragraph exercises the project style file, page margins, paragraph spacing, and the explicit table metadata used by the output post-processors.</p> <table data-alignment="right" data-autofit="window" data-cell_spacing="0pt" data-row_height="0.5cm" id="tbl:styled"> <caption>Table 1 A styled table.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>Item</th> <th>Value</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>One</td> <td>Two</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-custom-style="Para After Table"> <p>
<span id="eq:styled">
<span class="display math"> \int_0^1 x\,dx = \frac{1}{2} \tag{1}</span>
</span>
</p> </div> </main> </body> </html>
